    ex:summary "The LAEI 2010 has since been superseded. Click here for the full list of releases. There are 187 Air Quality Focus Areas in the Capital. These are locations that not only exceed the EU annual mean limit value for NO2 but are also locations with high human exposure. The Focus Areas were defined to address concerns raised by boroughs within the LAQM review process and forecasted air pollution trends. This is not an exhaustive list of London’s hotspot locations, but where the GLA believe the problem to be most acute. GIS Files (Zip) 117 KB Supporting Information (Zip) 241 KB" ;
    schema:relatedTo ex:Dataset_7,
        ex:Dataset_9 ;
    schema:url <https://data.london.gov.uk/download/air-quality-focus-areas/4c3b8f5c-af90-41b5-9670-63c8f11fe566/focus-areas.xls> .

